<article class="editorial-page"><p class="eyebrow">Policies & customer care</p><h1 class="title-xl" style="margin-top:.75rem">Shipping & Returns</h1><p class="copy" style="margin-top:1rem">At LIVOARA, we aim to make delivery simple, transparent, and reliable.</p><section class="copy-section"><h2>Return / refund request window</h2><p class="copy">A refund or return request is valid only if raised within 7 calendar days from the date the customer receives the order.</p></section><section class="copy-section"><h2>Mandatory unboxing video</h2><p class="copy">For any return, refund, or exchange request, a clear, continuous unboxing video is mandatory.</p></section><section class="copy-section"><h2>Shipping charges and delivery timeline</h2><p class="copy">Shipping charges and estimated delivery timelines are displayed during checkout wherever possible.</p></section><section class="copy-section"><h2>Contact</h2><p class="copy">Email hello@livoara.in with your order number for support.</p></section></article>{% schema %}{"name":"Shipping and returns","settings":[]} {% endschema %}